{
  "bodyHash": "xqJxuIO4gbg=",
  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Polytone</span></strong></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\" width=\"163\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/patreon.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\" width=\"180\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/social/twitter-plural/cozy.svg\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\" width=\"189\" height=\"55\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/youtube.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"YouTube频道\" width=\"183\" height=\"50\"></a>&nbsp;</h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7SXNHTv.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>📖 关于&nbsp;📖</strong></h2><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Polytone 是一个客户端<strong>自定义</strong>模组，允许通过<strong>资源包</strong>对游戏的各个方面进行广泛的调整。<br><br><br>模组有详尽的文档在<strong><a href=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/polytone/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a></strong>中，包含一个示例资源包。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如有疑问，请随时联系我，并记得将 Polytone 添加到你的资源包的可选依赖部分。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">主要功能包括：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自定义<strong>客户端粒子</strong> <strong>✨</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自定义<strong>后期着色器 🌅</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong>实体模型粒子发射器 🦋</strong></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自定义<strong><strong>客户端音效 🎵</strong></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>自定义创造模式标签页 🏷️</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>配置界面</strong>用于禁用<strong>资源包覆盖 🔧</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">移动 GUI 槽位&nbsp;🗓️</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>添加 GUI 元素</strong> 📒</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>自定义物品模型</strong>🗡️</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">修改<strong>现有粒子🖌️</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>添加/移除<strong>物品提示</strong>&nbsp;🪡</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>更改物品稀有度💍</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自定义<strong>地图颜色 </strong><strong>🗺️</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">更改<strong>方块音效 🪅</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自定义方块<strong>颜色映射&nbsp;🎨</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>自定义<strong>粒子颜色🍭</strong></strong><strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">方块偏移类型&nbsp;📐</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">随时间变化的动画纹理☀️</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>流体颜色映射&nbsp;🍸</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自定义<strong>生物群系颜色与粒子 🌄</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>更改<strong>刷怪蛋颜色&nbsp;🐣</strong></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自定义<strong>天空颜色&nbsp;🌈</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">注册音效事件&nbsp;🔔</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">更改云层高度和天空颜色&nbsp;☁️</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>以及更多！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">它还提供了与 Optifine 之前提供的 <strong>color.properties</strong> 系统的向后兼容性，使得现有资源包中的这些功能也能正常工作。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">该模组设计为快速且尽可能轻量，同时保持最大的自定义能力。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">它不仅提供了 color.properties 系统的替代方案，还提供了以前无法提供的更多功能和自定义选项。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">欢迎在你的资源包中使用这个横幅，别忘了在评论区<strong>展示你的作品</strong>！</span><br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polytone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/788/551/polytone_banner2.png\" alt=\"polytone_banner\" width=\"250\"></a></p><p>如果你使用的是 Sodium 1.20，请注意某些功能可能无法正常工作。最显著的问题是由于<a href=\"https://github.com/CaffeineMC/sodium-fabric/issues/2298\" rel=\"nofollow\">这个 Sodium 问题</a>导致的。</p><p>建议改用 Embeddium。</p><p>另外，请查看这个网站 <a href=\"https://github.com/LambdAurora/optifine_alternatives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/LambdAurora/optifine_alternatives</a><br><br>目前受支持的 Polytone 版本：</p><p><strong>1.20.1, 1.21.1, 1.21.5, 1.21.11</strong></p><p><strong>如果你不想遇到 bug 并希望获得所有最新功能，请避免使用其他版本。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7SXNHTv.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>📦 已知资源包📦</strong></h2><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffogulous\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/fogulous</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpolyshader%252fgallery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/polyshader/gallery</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fvisual-effects-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/visual-effects-plus</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252funique-goat-horns%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/texture-pack/unique-goat-horns/</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/shrimps-distinct-potions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/shrimps-distinct-potions</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fvariant-paintings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/variant-paintings</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4cy5s2UN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/4cy5s2UN</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/minecraft-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/minecraft-reimagined</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252flight-leak%252fversion%252f1.4.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/light-leak/version/1.4.0</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/golden-days\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/golden-days</a>&nbsp;</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/rainbows-foliage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/rainbows-foliage</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fknishles-beautiful-colormap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/knishles-beautiful-colormap</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sunbathing-godrays\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sunbathing-godrays</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/iron-oceans-blood-oceans-inspired-by-iron-lung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/iron-oceans-blood-oceans-inspired-by-iron-lung</a></strong></li>\n</ul><p><strong>想让你的资源包出现在这里？欢迎随时联系我。<br><br>这并非完整列表，仅包括社区向我提交的资源包。<br><br>小提示：请查看上方的“依赖项”部分，了解所有已知的资源包。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7SXNHTv.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️支持我❤️</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Polytone 是一个<strong>免费</strong>模组</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">喜欢<strong>Polytone 资源包</strong>？考虑捐赠吧<br>模组开发占据了我大量时间，所以如果你喜欢我的工作并愿意支持我，可以在此进行捐赠。如果你这样做，你将获得为你定制的<strong>地球仪</strong>和/或<strong>雕像</strong>！如果你使用代码“supplementaries”从 Akliz 购买服务器，同样适用。<br><br>也欢迎提出更多功能建议！我会很乐意听取你的建议。<br><br></span></p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p><div style=\"text-align:left\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要服务器？看看 Akliz，他们为模组 Minecraft 提供顶级品牌服务器。</span></div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">他们确实拥有一个友好的社区，提供出色的支持，服务器运行完美</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用代码 \"supplementaries\" 可享<strong>20%折扣</strong>，同时也能支持我的工作！</span><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7SXNHTv.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我们的模组🦉</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"Haunted Harvest\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"Snowy Spirit\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"Storage Labels\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"Goated\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"Mysyical Oak Tree\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpeted-stairs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/658/179/638058347698730749.png\" alt=\"Carpeted Stairs\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"MmmMmmMmmMmm\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/490/709/637798404029150212.png\" alt=\"Moyai\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/438/886/637685255314420532.png\" alt=\"Jeed\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-lily-pads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/551/229/637888507256267100.png\" alt=\"Better Lily Pads\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-frames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/798/638115339656250649.png\" alt=\"Advancement Frames\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randomium-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/800/638115342928765853.png\" alt=\"Randomium\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sleep-tight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/788/418/638141921847312709.png\" alt=\"Sleep Tight\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/heartstone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/555/637793261935851502.gif\" alt=\"Heartstone\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a></p><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div>",
